  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Emma wanted to celebrate her friend Luis's birthday.",
          "ja": "エマは友人ルイスの誕生日を祝いたかった。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She planned a surprise party with several classmates.",
          "ja": "数人の級友とサプライズパーティーを計画した。"
        },
        {
          "en": "They chose a busy restaurant near their school.",
          "ja": "学校近くの混雑するレストランを選んだ。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Emma thought that Luis would enjoy a large party.",
          "ja": "ルイスは大きなパーティーを楽しむと思った。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Her friend Nina asked Emma a question.",
          "ja": "友人ニーナはエマに質問した。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Did Luis really like surprise parties?",
          "ja": "ルイスは本当にサプライズパーティーが好きなのか。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Emma suddenly remembered that he often preferred quiet places.",
          "ja": "エマは彼がよく静かな場所を好んでいたことを突然思い出した。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She decided to ask him about his birthday plans.",
          "ja": "誕生日の予定について本人に尋ねることにした。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Luis said that he would enjoy having lunch with two or three friends.",
          "ja": "ルイスは二、三人の友人と昼食を食べるのが楽しいだろうと言った。"
        },
        {
          "en": "He also wanted to spend the afternoon drawing in a park.",
          "ja": "午後は公園で絵を描いて過ごしたいとも思っていた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Emma listened carefully to his wishes.",
          "ja": "エマは希望をよく聞いた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She changed the plan after talking to her classmates.",
          "ja": "級友と話した後計画を変えた。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "On his birthday, Luis met his friends at a small café.",
          "ja": "誕生日、ルイスは小さなカフェで友達に会った。"
        },
        {
          "en": "They gave him a card with messages from their classmates.",
          "ja": "級友からのメッセージが書かれたカードを渡した。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Later, they walked to the park together.",
          "ja": "後で一緒に公園へ歩いた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Luis enjoyed the simple celebration very much.",
          "ja": "ルイスは素朴なお祝いをとても楽しんだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Emma learned that a wonderful plan for one person might not suit someone else.",
          "ja": "エマは一人にとって素晴らしい計画が別の人に合うとは限らないと学んだ。"
        },
        {
          "en": "She still enjoyed planning special events.",
          "ja": "特別行事の計画は今も楽しかった。"
        },
        {
          "en": "However, she began to ask others what they wanted.",
          "ja": "しかし他の人に何を望むか尋ね始めた。"
        },
        {
          "en": "A good celebration reflects the wishes of the person being celebrated.",
          "ja": "よい祝いは祝われる人の希望を反映する。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
